<title>SWEDEN: UPM-Kymmene sells 4.5 mln Nokia shares.</title>
<headline>UPM-Kymmene sells 4.5 mln Nokia shares.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Europe's largest forestry group UPM-Kymmene on Wednesday said it sold 4.5 million shares in Finnish telecoms group Nokia for a pre-tax capital gain of 1.5 billion markka ($290.4 million). ($ = 5.166 Finnish Markka)</p>
</text>
